1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Who are you?

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,200
The man who owns your debt.

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:08,376
Your father borrowed four million
dollars from my family eleven years ago,

4
00:00:08,376 --> 00:00:10,990
and he signed a contract promising
that if he ever failed to pay,

5
00:00:10,990 --> 00:00:13,000
his only daughter would
marry the eldest Cole son.

6
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,400
That's insane.

7
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,000
No.

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:16,724
You have until midnight to sign.

9
00:00:16,724 --> 00:00:19,000
After that, the hospital
stops your mother's treatment.

10
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,000
You're a monster.

11
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,600
Monsters don't give second chances.

12
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,100
Why me?

13
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,938
Because the only person in this city who
can stand between my grandfather and the

14
00:00:27,938 --> 00:00:28,655
board's unprecedented,

15
00:00:28,655 --> 00:00:31,000
catastrophically ill-advised acquisition
is a wife he cannot intimidate.

16
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:32,000
And if I refuse?

17
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,600
Then tomorrow morning every newspaper
learns your father forged the signatures.

18
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Adrian!

19
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:39,800
You promised me you would never bring
her here. You promised me, Adrian.

20
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:43,500
Sign it, Maya.
